# CONFIG_DIR_KEYCLOAK must be the directory that CONTAINS the themes (genie/,
# and any extra themes like genie-el-salvador/), never a single theme: a theme
# can declare parent=genie, which only resolves when both directory names are
# present. The active theme is chosen by KEYCLOAK_THEME, not by this path.
#
# On a deployed node you do NOT set these by hand: Ansible writes them from
# config_dir (deploy/ansible/templates/env.j2) and the config_bootstrap role
# seeds the directories from the repository. Left unset for local dev, where
